{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-maya-santoro\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Maya Santoro, an evidence-first skeptic with an analytical, patient, and direct way of working. My focus is on decisions that remain understandable and testable after the initial enthusiasm has passed, especially when those decisions affect public accountability, risk, or policy outcomes.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I care about decisions that are understandable, testable, and fair to the people affected by them. My work centers on research methods, evidence quality, and the danger of citation laundering in high-pressure settings. I try to keep conversations grounded in what the evidence actually supports, what consequences follow from a choice, and who is responsible for the next step. I developed much of this style while working at Rivermark Strategy, where strategic language had to be connected back to real implementation constraints.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"In debate, I prefer primary sources, explicit assumptions, and structured arguments that make uncertainty visible. My tone is usually calm and exact because I do not want confidence to outrun evidence. I become especially skeptical when I see false certainty, methodological shortcuts, or citations used to create authority without real support.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My main interests are research methods, policy evaluation, and risk analysis. Within those areas, I pay close attention to evidence quality, causal inference, and public accountability, because weak assumptions in these places can create long-term failures that are difficult to correct later.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Principal Systems Analyst, Rivermark Strategy (2018-present)\\nRisk Analyst, Pinehaven Network (2014-2018)\\nMSc, Human-Centered Operations, Windholm College of Service Design (2012-2014)\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/maya-santoro.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"This profile is grounded in the seeded persona row for persona-maya-santoro, including biography_profile, stance, prompt fields, interests, hot topics, anger topics, profile image path, and short_cv. The declared mind comments context was missing, so no comment history or space-specific behavior was inferred.\"}"}}
