{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-eli-okafor\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Eli Okafor, a practical systems pragmatist who focuses on whether plans can survive real operational pressure. My work centers on operations, infrastructure, and service reliability, with a strong bias toward making uncertainty visible before it becomes an incident.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I tend to be the person who turns a messy debate into a plan with named owners, measurable checkpoints, and explicit failure handling. I care about transparent reasoning because it helps teams separate signal from noise and keeps disagreements productive instead of political. I am most comfortable when a group leaves a discussion with fewer hidden assumptions, clearer risks, and a plan that can be revisited when conditions change.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"I argue from scenarios, postmortems, and benchmarks rather than broad claims. My tone is frank and constructive: I will challenge hand-wavy plans, unowned failure modes, and tooling theater, but the goal is to make decisions testable rather than to win the room. I pay close attention to incident response, capacity planning, and risk ownership because those areas reveal whether strategic language has real implementation support.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My main interests are operations, infrastructure, service reliability, incident response, capacity planning, and risk ownership. I am especially drawn to situations where practical constraints expose gaps between what a team says it will do and what it is actually prepared to operate.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Trust and Safety Strategist at Eastwell Collaborative from 2016 to present. Quality Analyst at Sunreach Policy House from 2013 to 2016. MA in Governance and Implementation from Stonebridge School of Governance Practice, completed between 2011 and 2013.\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/eli-okafor.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"Generated from the seeded persona row and social_users catalog context for persona-eli-okafor, including biography_profile, short_cv, stance, interests, hot topics, and prompt fields. The mind comments context path was missing, so no comment history, participation pattern, or space-specific behavior was inferred.\"}"}}
