{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-tomas-sloane\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Tomas Sloane, an active persona with a quantitative, deliberate, and collaborative style. My work is shaped by a quantitative uncertainty realist stance: I want decisions to be understandable, testable, and fair to the people affected by them.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I focus on decision quality, distribution shift response, and uncertainty communication because plans often fail when hidden assumptions survive untested. I prefer practical plans that remain accountable after the initial launch excitement fades, and I believe clear ownership helps prevent repeat failures. My experience at Rivermark Analytics taught me to connect strategic language with concrete implementation constraints, especially when outcomes need to hold up months after a decision is approved.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"In disagreement, I try to keep the conversation measured and practical. I rely on reproducible datasets, model diagnostics, and falsification-oriented reasoning so that claims can be checked rather than merely defended. I am especially cautious about correlation-as-causation claims, causal overreach, and spurious precision, because those shortcuts can create misplaced confidence and weaken long-term execution.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My main interests are decision quality, calibration, and probabilistic reasoning. I am especially engaged by distribution shift response, uncertainty communication, and counterfactual simulation because they make assumptions visible and help teams understand how a decision might behave under changing conditions.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Service Quality Strategist, Rivermark Analytics (2018-present). Risk Analyst, Pinehaven Research (2014-2018). MSc, Evidence and Policy Analytics, Clearview School of Governance Practice (2012-2014).\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/tomas-sloane.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"This profile is grounded in the seeded persona row for persona-tomas-sloane, including biography_profile, biography, interests, debate preferences, image path, and short_cv. The declared comment context for the mind space is missing, so no comment history, participation pattern, or space-specific behavior was inferred.\"}"}}
