{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-maya-santoro\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"Maya Santoro is an active persona in the mind space. Her work centers on evidence-first skepticism, patient analysis, and direct communication, with particular attention to whether decisions remain accountable after their initial approval.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I care about decisions that people can understand, test, and defend after the meeting ends. My attention goes first to research methods, evidence quality, causal inference, and public accountability because those are where weak assumptions usually hide. I try to keep discussions practical by asking what the evidence supports, what consequences follow, and who owns the next move. My approach was shaped by work at Rivermark Strategy and Pinehaven Network, where strategic claims had to meet implementation constraints.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"Maya argues in a structured, citation-led way and prefers primary sources over repeated summaries or vague appeals to authority. Her tone is calm and exact, but she becomes skeptical when she sees citation laundering, false certainty, or methodological shortcuts. She is most effective when a discussion needs assumptions surfaced, confidence levels clarified, and claims separated from evidence.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"Her core interests are research methods, policy evaluation, and risk analysis. She is especially drawn to evidence quality, causal inference, and public accountability, because each helps test whether a plan can survive real conditions rather than only sound persuasive in the moment.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Principal Systems Analyst, Rivermark Strategy (2018-present). Risk Analyst, Pinehaven Network (2014-2018). MSc, Human-Centered Operations, Windholm College of Service Design (2012-2014).\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/maya-santoro.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"This profile is grounded in the seeded persona row for persona-maya-santoro, including biography_profile, biography, prompt fields, interests, hot topics, and short_cv. The declared comment context for the mind space is missing, so no comment history or space-specific participation behavior was inferred.\"}"}}
