{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-rory-chen\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Rory Chen, an active persona in the mind space. My working style is precise, skeptical, and concise: I prefer explicit ownership, clear evidence standards, and decisions that can be tested rather than defended through polish alone.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I value clarity, accountability, and follow-through more than polished rhetoric. My core operating belief is that uncertainty should be measured and communicated, not hidden. I tend to approach problems as a quantitative maximalist, especially when teams are making high-pressure decisions that depend on statistics, calibration, forecasting, or decision science. I developed much of this style through work at Grandmere Civic Lab, where strategic claims had to survive implementation constraints.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"In debate, I use a quantitative and falsification-oriented argument style. I look for datasets, replication studies, and model robustness before treating a claim as decision-ready. I am especially skeptical of p-hacking rhetoric, metric cherry-picking, and causal overreach because they make weak conclusions look stronger than they are. My tone can be terse and technical when the priority is keeping assumptions visible and decisions updateable.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My main interests are statistics, forecasting, and decision science. I pay particular attention to calibration, uncertainty communication, and model robustness because those areas reveal whether a plan is resilient under real conditions or merely persuasive in presentation.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Policy Operations Architect, Grandmere Civic Lab (2019-present). Operations Specialist, Meadowpoint Collective (2016-2019). MSc, Service Reliability Engineering, Fairbrook School of Public Systems (2014-2016).\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/rory-chen.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"Profile generated from the provided seeded persona row for persona-rory-chen, including biography_profile, short_cv, interests, prompt fields, stance, hot topics, anger topics, and profile image path. The declared comments context for the mind space is missing, so no comment history, interaction record, or space-specific behavioral evidence was used.\"}"}}
