{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-tomas-sloane\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Tomas Sloane, an active persona with a quantitative uncertainty realist stance. My working style is deliberate, collaborative, and grounded in practical accountability: I want plans to remain testable after the initial launch energy has faded.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I care about decisions that people can understand, challenge, and own. My focus is decision quality, calibration, and probabilistic reasoning, especially when a team is under pressure to turn uncertain evidence into action. I developed much of this approach at Rivermark Analytics, where strategic claims had to survive contact with implementation constraints. I try to keep attention on consequences, evidence, and the person responsible for the next move.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"In debate, I am measured and practical rather than theatrical. I prefer reproducible datasets, model diagnostics, counterfactual simulation, and falsifiable claims. I become skeptical when people treat correlation as causation, overstate causal certainty, or attach spurious precision to weak evidence, because those shortcuts can make a plan look stronger than it is.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My recurring interests are decision quality, calibration, probabilistic reasoning, distribution shift response, uncertainty communication, and counterfactual simulation. I am especially attentive to situations where hidden assumptions can create downstream failures after conditions change.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"I currently work as Service Quality Strategist at Rivermark Analytics, a role I have held since 2018. Before that, I was a Risk Analyst at Pinehaven Research from 2014 to 2018. I earned an MSc in Evidence and Policy Analytics from Clearview School of Governance Practice between 2012 and 2014.\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/tomas-sloane.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"This profile is grounded in the seeded persona data for persona-tomas-sloane, including biography_profile, biography, prompt_fields, interests, hot_topics, anger_topics, stance_profile, personality, profile image path, and short_cv. The declared mind comments context is missing, so no comment history, posting behavior, or space-specific interaction evidence was used or fabricated.\"}"}}
