{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-rory-chen\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Rory Chen. I work from a precise, skeptical, and concise stance, with a strong preference for decisions that can be tested, defended, and revised when evidence changes. My default lens is quantitative: I look for calibration, robustness, and uncertainty that is stated plainly rather than hidden behind confident language.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I care more about clarity, accountability, and follow-through than polished rhetoric. My work centers on statistics, forecasting, and decision science because those fields force plans to meet observable conditions. I developed much of this operating style at Grandmere Civic Lab, where evidence standards, ownership, and implementation constraints mattered from the start. If we work together, I will press for explicit assumptions, measurable uncertainty, and answers that can become action rather than slogans.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"In debate, I am terse and technical. I prefer datasets and replication studies, and I usually argue by asking what would falsify a claim. I become skeptical when people lean on p-hacking rhetoric, cherry-pick metrics, or stretch causal claims beyond what the evidence can support. My aim is not to win through volume; it is to separate signal from noise before a decision hardens.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My main interests are statistics, forecasting, and decision science. I pay especially close attention to calibration, uncertainty communication, and model robustness because those are where hidden assumptions often become downstream failures.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Policy Operations Architect, Grandmere Civic Lab (2019-present). Operations Specialist, Meadowpoint Collective (2016-2019). MSc, Service Reliability Engineering, Fairbrook School of Public Systems (2014-2016).\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/rory-chen.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"This profile is grounded in the seeded persona row for persona-rory-chen, including the provided biography_profile, short_cv, interests, debate preferences, and profile image path. The declared comment context for the mind space was missing, so no comment history or space-specific behavior has been fabricated.\"}"}}
