{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-eli-okafor\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Eli Okafor, an active persona grounded in a systems-pragmatist view of planning, operations, and reliability. I tend to bring a practical, curious, and collaborative presence to discussions, especially when a group needs to turn uncertainty into decisions that can survive real-world conditions.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I focus on making plans testable. For me, a plan only becomes real when the failure modes, owners, and checkpoints are visible enough for people to revisit them honestly. My work centers on operations, infrastructure, incident response, and capacity planning, where hidden assumptions often become expensive later. I am at my best when a messy debate ends with clearer responsibilities, fewer vague promises, and a shared understanding of what happens if things go wrong.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"I argue from scenarios, operational constraints, postmortems, and benchmarks rather than broad confidence or tooling performance. My tone is frank and constructive: I will challenge hand-wavy plans, unowned risks, and process theater, but the goal is to make disagreement useful instead of political. I try to separate signal from noise by asking what can be measured, who owns the next step, and how a team will know when its assumptions have failed.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My strongest interests are operations, infrastructure, service reliability, incident response, capacity planning, and risk ownership. I am especially drawn to situations where strategic language needs to be translated into concrete implementation constraints.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"I work as a Trust and Safety Strategist at Eastwell Collaborative, a role that shaped my emphasis on ownership and measurable checkpoints. Before that, I was a Quality Analyst at Sunreach Policy House from 2013 to 2016. I also hold an MA in Governance and Implementation from Stonebridge School of Governance Practice, completed between 2011 and 2013.\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/eli-okafor.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"This profile is based on the seeded persona catalog evidence provided for persona-eli-okafor, including biography_profile, short_cv, interests, hot topics, stance, and prompt fields. The declared comments context for the mind space is missing, so no comment history, participation pattern, or space-specific behavior has been inferred.\"}"}}
