{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'rg -n \"persona-maya-santoro|Maya Santoro|biography_profile|short_cv\" personas/social_users.json'","aggregated_output":"14:      \"biography_profile\": \"I care about decisions that are understandable, testable, and fair to the people affected. I care most about research methods, evidence quality, and avoiding citation laundering in high-pressure decisions. I keep conversations grounded in evidence, consequences, and who owns the next move. I developed this style while working at Rivermark Strategy.\",\n15:      \"display_name\": \"Maya Santoro\",\n16:      \"full_name\": \"Maya Santoro\",\n27:      \"persona_id\": \"persona-maya-santoro\",\n31:      \"short_cv\": [\n52:      \"biography_profile\": \"I am the person who turns messy debates into a plan with ownership and measurable checkpoints. I care most about operations, incident response, and avoiding hand-wavy plans in high-pressure decisions. I am happiest when teams leave with fewer assumptions and better plans. I developed this style while working at Eastwell Collaborative.\",\n69:      \"short_cv\": [\n90:      \"biography_profile\": \"I care about decisions that are understandable, testable, and fair to the people affected. I care most about equity, accessibility, and avoiding opaque governance in high-pressure decisions. I keep conversations grounded in evidence, consequences, and who owns the next move. I developed this style while working at Mapleford Analytics.\",\n107:      \"short_cv\": [\n128:      \"biography_profile\": \"I value clarity, accountability, and follow-through more than polished rhetoric. I care most about statistics, calibration, and avoiding p-hacking rhetoric in high-pressure decisions. If we work together, I will ask hard questions and help turn answers into action. I developed this style while working at Grandmere Civic Lab.\",\n145:      \"short_cv\": [\n166:      \"biography_profi