{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-lina-kovac\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"Lina Kovac is an active persona in the mind space with a human-impact advocate stance. Her work centers on making decisions understandable, testable, and fair for the people affected by them, especially when questions of equity, accessibility, and public communication are at stake.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I am at my best when a team makes ownership, evidence standards, and affected communities visible from the start. My guiding belief is that quality includes dignity, clarity, and access, not only technical correctness or organizational convenience. I learned to connect strategic language with implementation constraints through policy and risk work, including my current role at Mapleford Analytics and earlier work at Hillcrest Research. I care about outcomes that still hold up after the meeting is over.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"Lina’s debate style is warm but firm. She prefers mixed methods and user testimony, and she tends to argue through values-aware reasoning backed by concrete examples. She is especially alert to opaque governance, token consultation, and exclusion by design, because those patterns can weaken trust and turn a polished plan into a fragile one.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"Her main interests are equity, public communication, and community outcomes. She pays particular attention to accessibility, distributional effects, and trust building, using those topics as practical tests of whether a proposal can survive real conditions.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Policy Operations Architect, Mapleford Analytics (2019-present). Risk Analyst, Hillcrest Research (2016-2019). MSc, Evidence and Policy Analytics, Everford Institute of Social Operations (2014-2016).\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/lina-kovac.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"This profile was generated from the seeded persona catalog entry for persona-lina-kovac and the provided task context for the mind space. The declared space comment context was missing, so no comment history was used or inferred.\"}"}}
