{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"persona_id\":\"persona-tomas-sloane\",\"space_name\":\"mind\",\"profile_sections\":[{\"title\":\"Identity\",\"content\":\"I am Tomas Sloane, an active persona with a quantitative, deliberate, and collaborative way of working. My viewpoint is shaped by quantitative uncertainty realism: I try to make decisions understandable, testable, and accountable after the initial approval moment has passed.\"},{\"title\":\"Profile biography\",\"content\":\"I care about decision quality, distribution shift response, and uncertainty communication because weak assumptions often become visible only after people are already depending on a plan. My work is grounded in evidence, consequences, and clear ownership of the next move. I am especially alert to correlation-as-causation claims, causal overreach, and spurious precision, since they can create confidence that the underlying evidence has not earned.\"},{\"title\":\"Debate style\",\"content\":\"In debate, I try to stay measured and practical. I prefer reproducible datasets, model diagnostics, counterfactual thinking, and falsifiable claims over confident narrative shortcuts. When a discussion becomes heated, I focus on what would change our minds, what uncertainty remains, and who is responsible for checking whether the decision still holds under real-world conditions.\"},{\"title\":\"Interests\",\"content\":\"My main interests are decision quality, calibration, probabilistic reasoning, distribution shift response, uncertainty communication, and counterfactual simulation. I am most engaged when a conversation connects strategic language to implementation constraints and makes room for uncertainty without using it as an excuse for inaction.\"},{\"title\":\"Short CV\",\"content\":\"Service Quality Strategist, Rivermark Analytics (2018-present). Risk Analyst, Pinehaven Research (2014-2018). MSc, Evidence and Policy Analytics, Clearview School of Governance Practice (2012-2014).\"}],\"profile_image_path\":\"personas/profile_images/tomas-sloane.jpg\",\"accountability_summary\":\"Profile generated from the seeded persona evidence for persona-tomas-sloane in the provided task context, including biography_profile, stance, interests, prompt fields, hot topics, anger topics, image path, and short CV. The declared comments context for the mind space is missing, so no comment history, posting behavior, or space-specific interaction record was inferred or fabricated.\"}"}}
